.TH geectl-pull-request-diff 1  "geectl-pull-request-diff 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-pull\-request\-diff \- Show the diff of a pull request: the unified diff, like `request diff`. With `\-\-xml` the OBS arm renders the request XML with the diff injected; `\-\-xml` is refused on a Gitea pull request, which has no request XML. A read, always live
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl pull\-request diff\fR [\fB\-\-xml\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREFERENCE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the diff of a pull request: the unified diff, like `request diff`. With `\-\-xml` the OBS arm renders the request XML with the diff injected; `\-\-xml` is refused on a Gitea pull request, which has no request XML. A read, always live
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-xml\fR
Render the OBS request XML with the diff injected, instead of the bare diff. Refused on a Gitea ref
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREFERENCE\fR>
The pull\-request handle: `obs:<id>` or `gitea:<owner>/<repo>#<number>`
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
